<article id="post-5975" class="hitmag-single post-5975 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-10">

		
	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<div class="cat-links"><a href="https://yushan-news.com/category/%e5%8f%b0%e4%b8%ad/" rel="category tag">台中</a></div><h1 class="entry-title">野心勃勃的戰略佈局  民眾黨台中提名「遍地開花」</h1>		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="posted-on"><a href="https://yushan-news.com/%e9%87%8e%e5%bf%83%e5%8b%83%e5%8b%83%e7%9a%84%e6%88%b0%e7%95%a5%e4%bd%88%e5%b1%80-%e6%b0%91%e7%9c%be%e9%bb%a8%e5%8f%b0%e4%b8%ad%e6%8f%90%e5%90%8d%e3%80%8c%e9%81%8d%e5%9c%b0%e9%96%8b%e8%8a%b1/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-04-06T21:48:38+08:00">2026 年 4 月 6 日</time></a></span><span class="meta-sep"> - </span><span class="byline"> by <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://yushan-news.com/author/yushan-news/">電子報 玉山新聞</a></span></span><span class="meta-sep"> - </span><span class="comments-link"><a href="https://yushan-news.com/%e9%87%8e%e5%bf%83%e5%8b%83%e5%8b%83%e7%9a%84%e6%88%b0%e7%95%a5%e4%bd%88%e5%b1%80-%e6%b0%91%e7%9c%be%e9%bb%a8%e5%8f%b0%e4%b8%ad%e6%8f%90%e5%90%8d%e3%80%8c%e9%81%8d%e5%9c%b0%e9%96%8b%e8%8a%b1/#respond">Leave a Comment</a></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
		
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->
	
	<a class="image-link" href="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-11.jpg"><img width="735" height="400" src="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-11-735x400.jpg" class="attachment-hitmag-featured size-hitmag-featured wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" /></a>
	
	<div class="entry-content">
		<p><strong> 美女牌+老將齊發   劍指「關鍵少數」   牽動台中市議會藍綠版圖</strong></p>
<p>(記者李文捷／分析報導)民眾黨決心搶攻今年底改選的台中市議員席次，在各選區「遍地開花」提名，已造成藍、綠營的威脅。目前民眾黨已完成大里霧峰、后里豐原、西屯、太平與北屯選區的提名，據了解還打算在海線、東南區、中西區與南屯都提人選。據政黨人士觀察，民眾黨不僅企圖攻下3席議員以能在議會成立黨團，有可能想「以小搏大」，成為議會的「關鍵少數」，影響正副議長選舉，甚至未來市政議題。</p>
<p><strong>以小搏大   藍綠不過半、白營主導議會</strong></p>
<p>據中部資深的政治觀察人士指出，目前民眾黨台中市黨部主委陳清龍，以往就是操作「關鍵少數」的高手；之前他在擔任台中市議員期間，就曾結合無黨籍與泛藍議員成立「超黨派聯盟」，在林佳龍執政台中時代成為影響力超大的「次團」，在議會以小搏大，擁有極大化的話語權。</p>
<p>這一次他主導民眾黨在台中市各區議員參選人提名，採取「遍地開花」模式，幾乎各區都提出人選，有些參選人是在地經營許久的老將，也有知名網紅或美女牌，各具亮點，已成為威脅國民黨與民進黨原本議會生態的最大變數。</p>
<p><strong>穩固基層    江和樹拚連任  連小華被看好</strong></p>
<p>據了解，目前民眾黨已完成提名部分，其中后里豐原提名的連小華是陳清龍的妻子，原本就曾擔任過豐原市民代表，口條不錯，在豐后區有基本盤，尤其在陳清龍大力輔選之下上榜機會頗大。另大里霧峰區的江和樹是目前唯一的民眾黨議員，他能說會道，網路聲量極高，據研判爭取連任也沒有問題。</p>
<figure id="attachment_5913" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-5913" style="width: 516px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-5913" src="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-8-225x300.jpg" alt="" width="516" height="688" srcset="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-8-225x300.jpg 225w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-8-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-8.jpg 1108w" sizes="(max-width: 516px) 100vw, 516px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-5913" class="wp-caption-text">江和樹祈求神助，順利連任。</figcaption></figure>
<figure id="attachment_5915" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-5915" style="width: 517px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-5915" src="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-10-169x300.jpg" alt="" width="517" height="918" srcset="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-10-169x300.jpg 169w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-10-576x1024.jpg 576w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-10-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-10-864x1536.jpg 864w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-10.jpg 960w" sizes="(max-width: 517px) 100vw, 517px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-5915" class="wp-caption-text">陳清龍夫人連小華，代夫出征豐后區。</figcaption></figure>
<p><strong>美女奇兵   楊寶楨傳空降   劉芩妤戰西屯</strong></p>
<p>另在西屯區提名的劉芩妤，她不光有外表優勢，且長期經營社群與網路節目，是民眾黨打出的美女牌；另曾擔任民眾黨發言人、也是新竹市政府發言人的楊寶楨，是另一枚「美女牌」，她雖尚未獲得提名，但已自行在臉書宣布，有可能加入台中東南區的戰局。</p>
<figure id="attachment_5914" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-5914" style="width: 518px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="wp-image-5914" src="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-9-246x300.jpg" alt="" width="518" height="632" srcset="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-9-246x300.jpg 246w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-9.jpg 690w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 518px) 100vw, 518px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-5914" class="wp-caption-text">美女刺客楊寶楨，動向備受矚目。</figcaption></figure>
<figure id="attachment_5916" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-5916" style="width: 519px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="wp-image-5916" src="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-11-240x300.jpg" alt="" width="519" height="649" srcset="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-11-240x300.jpg 240w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-11-768x961.jpg 768w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-11.jpg 810w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 519px) 100vw, 519px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-5916" class="wp-caption-text">劉芩妤合體盧秀燕，展現藍白合戰力。</figcaption></figure>
<p><strong>全區插旗   海線覓才、南屯邀吳佩芸加盟</strong></p>
<p>另還有在北屯區經營許久、已在初選勝出的邱于珊；及太平確定提名的許書豪；海線也打算提名，以沙鹿區六路里長陳永祥最為積極；另中央委員許瑞宏有意參選中西區，南屯區有洪鑫任。據了解民眾黨仍積極與南屯區現任無黨籍議員吳佩芸爭取入黨，希望壯大民眾黨在台中市議會的席次。</p>
<figure id="attachment_5917" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-5917" style="width: 518px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="wp-image-5917" src="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-12-262x300.jpg" alt="" width="518" height="593" srcset="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-12-262x300.jpg 262w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-12.jpg 428w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 518px) 100vw, 518px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-5917" class="wp-caption-text">吳佩芸可能加入民眾黨拼連任?</figcaption></figure>
<figure id="attachment_5918" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-5918" style="width: 517px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="wp-image-5918" src="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-13-225x300.jpg" alt="" width="517" height="689" srcset="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-13-225x300.jpg 225w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-13-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-13-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/jnrxfxd-13.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 517px) 100vw, 517px" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-5918" class="wp-caption-text">許瑞宏合體館長，備戰中西區。</figcaption></figure>
<div class="addtoany_share_save_container addtoany_content addtoany_content_bottom"><div class="a2a_kit a2a_kit_size_32 addtoany_list" data-a2a-url="https://yushan-news.com/%e9%87%8e%e5%bf%83%e5%8b%83%e5%8b%83%e7%9a%84%e6%88%b0%e7%95%a5%e4%bd%88%e5%b1%80-%e6%b0%91%e7%9c%be%e9%bb%a8%e5%8f%b0%e4%b8%ad%e6%8f%90%e5%90%8d%e3%80%8c%e9%81%8d%e5%9c%b0%e9%96%8b%e8%8a%b1/" data-a2a-title="野心勃勃的戰略佈局  民眾黨台中提名「遍地開花」"><a class="a2a_button_facebook" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/facebook?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fyushan-news.com%2F%25e9%2587%258e%25e5%25bf%2583%25e5%258b%2583%25e5%258b%2583%25e7%259a%2584%25e6%2588%25b0%25e7%2595%25a5%25e4%25bd%2588%25e5%25b1%2580-%25e6%25b0%2591%25e7%259c%25be%25e9%25bb%25a8%25e5%258f%25b0%25e4%25b8%25ad%25e6%258f%2590%25e5%2590%258d%25e3%2580%258c%25e9%2581%258d%25e5%259c%25b0%25e9%2596%258b%25e8%258a%25b1%2F&amp;linkname=%E9%87%8E%E5%BF%83%E5%8B%83%E5%8B%83%E7%9A%84%E6%88%B0%E7%95%A5%E4%BD%88%E5%B1%80%C2%A0%20%E6%B0%91%E7%9C%BE%E9%BB%A8%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%8F%90%E5%90%8D%E3%80%8C%E9%81%8D%E5%9C%B0%E9%96%8B%E8%8A%B1%E3%80%8D" title="Facebook" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"></a><a class="a2a_button_facebook_messenger" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/facebook_messenger?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fyushan-news.com%2F%25e9%2587%258e%25e5%25bf%2583%25e5%258b%2583%25e5%258b%2583%25e7%259a%2584%25e6%2588%25b0%25e7%2595%25a5%25e4%25bd%2588%25e5%25b1%2580-%25e6%25b0%2591%25e7%259c%25be%25e9%25bb%25a8%25e5%258f%25b0%25e4%25b8%25ad%25e6%258f%2590%25e5%2590%258d%25e3%2580%258c%25e9%2581%258d%25e5%259c%25b0%25e9%2596%258b%25e8%258a%25b1%2F&amp;linkname=%E9%87%8E%E5%BF%83%E5%8B%83%E5%8B%83%E7%9A%84%E6%88%B0%E7%95%A5%E4%BD%88%E5%B1%80%C2%A0%20%E6%B0%91%E7%9C%BE%E9%BB%A8%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%8F%90%E5%90%8D%E3%80%8C%E9%81%8D%E5%9C%B0%E9%96%8B%E8%8A%B1%E3%80%8D" title="Messenger" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank"></a><a class="a2a_button_line" href="https://www.addtoany.com/add_to/line?linkurl=https%3A%2F%2Fyushan-news.com%2F%25e9%2587%258e%25e