                        <img width="348" height="215" src="https://yushan-news.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/台中全球極限體能鋼鐵大賽-348x215.png" class="attachment-hitmag-grid size-hitmag-grid wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" />                    </a>
